WEBVTT

01:29.680 --> 01:33.800
ADAPTED FROM THE BLOSSOMING LOVE
BY SUI YU ER AN ON ICEREAD.COM

01:36.880 --> 01:39.160
Master told me to let him go.

01:40.320 --> 01:41.200
So that

01:41.760 --> 01:43.560
he owes me one for saving his life.

01:43.640 --> 01:45.600
Now I can follow him

01:46.720 --> 01:48.560
in search of a chance
to get a token of the Immortal Alliance.

01:50.240 --> 01:51.080
That doesn't add up.

01:52.760 --> 01:54.240
If His Grace did order this,

01:54.800 --> 01:56.120
why sent us to pursue him?

01:56.200 --> 01:58.000
To make it look real.

02:00.120 --> 02:01.920
How else can I make
Xie Xuechen believe me?

02:03.560 --> 02:05.760
He's not some stupid
low-ranking member of the Dark Clan.

02:08.000 --> 02:09.680
Since you are already here,

02:10.680 --> 02:12.080
try to trap him for the time being.

02:13.200 --> 02:14.160
I will intervene

02:15.000 --> 02:16.400
at the right time to save him.

02:17.440 --> 02:18.440
In that case,

02:19.360 --> 02:20.640
he'll owe me one more life.

02:23.080 --> 02:24.360
On the other hand,

02:24.960 --> 02:26.160
people's desire

02:27.160 --> 02:29.160
is always about fortune, sex, and fame.

02:30.280 --> 02:31.840
I'm a little curious about the desire

02:32.640 --> 02:34.800
of the top

02:35.680 --> 02:36.520
sword cultivator in the world.

02:48.360 --> 02:49.440
Meow!

02:51.160 --> 02:52.240
Meow, where are you?

02:54.560 --> 02:55.400
Meow!

02:56.920 --> 02:58.360
Come out, Meow!

03:00.040 --> 03:01.160
Meow!

03:06.520 --> 03:09.000
Meow! I brought you some dried fish.

03:09.080 --> 03:10.440
-You…
-Take up your sword!

03:11.840 --> 03:12.680
Father!

03:12.760 --> 03:14.120
Sword cultivators

03:14.200 --> 03:15.640
can never put their swords aside

03:15.720 --> 03:17.720
wherever they are at all times.

03:17.800 --> 03:19.320
I've made a mistake.

03:19.840 --> 03:21.440
Were you looking for that little snow cat?

03:23.880 --> 03:26.080
It will never come
to the Snow Cliff again.

03:26.920 --> 03:28.360
I killed it.

03:28.440 --> 03:29.840
Why?

03:30.440 --> 03:31.840
What kind of expression is that?

03:31.920 --> 03:34.320
Father, though snow cats
are demonic animals,

03:34.400 --> 03:35.400
they don't hurt people.

03:36.120 --> 03:37.600
Why did you kill it?

03:37.680 --> 03:39.920
-It's my newly met friend!
-Cultivators can't be sentimental.

03:40.000 --> 03:41.200
They shall devote themselves
to cultivation.

03:41.280 --> 03:42.320
Did you forget all about it?

03:42.400 --> 03:44.000
No. I don't understand.

03:44.080 --> 03:45.120
Mother said

03:45.200 --> 03:47.960
cultivators think
for all lives in the world,

03:48.040 --> 03:49.480
and their duty is to save people.

03:49.560 --> 03:51.600
Why can't we be sentimental?

03:51.680 --> 03:53.080
Save people.

03:53.160 --> 03:54.360
Think for all lives in the world.

03:54.440 --> 03:55.920
Is that your faith of cultivation?

03:58.120 --> 03:59.240
Answer me!

03:59.320 --> 04:00.680
Yes.

04:00.760 --> 04:01.600
Good.

04:02.280 --> 04:03.120
In that case,

04:03.640 --> 04:05.200
there's more reason for you
to be unattached.

04:06.640 --> 04:07.840
If you are biased,

04:08.520 --> 04:09.520
how can you accept all lives

04:09.600 --> 04:11.120
with a big heart?

04:11.720 --> 04:12.560
And if one day,

04:13.080 --> 04:14.320
you have to choose

04:14.400 --> 04:15.360
between the person you love

04:15.440 --> 04:17.120
and the world,

04:18.000 --> 04:19.839
would you be able to give up the one

04:19.920 --> 04:21.079
to save the world?

04:21.160 --> 04:23.240
Why do I have to pick one?

04:24.400 --> 04:25.840
A man born with an extra sense

04:26.600 --> 04:27.800
is rarely seen throughout history.

04:28.760 --> 04:29.800
Xuechen,

04:30.680 --> 04:32.120
you are meant to be extraordinary.

04:32.200 --> 04:33.360
You are destined to be
the best in the human realm,

04:33.440 --> 04:34.800
and even all three realms.

04:35.520 --> 04:36.720
When that day comes,

04:36.800 --> 04:38.160
the fate of the world

04:38.240 --> 04:39.640
will change with each of your choices.

04:40.600 --> 04:43.160
Love will be your weakness,

04:43.240 --> 04:45.960
and it will put the world in danger.

04:46.880 --> 04:48.000
Since your goal of cultivation

04:48.080 --> 04:49.560
is to think for all lives in the world,

04:49.640 --> 04:50.920
the thought focused on your sword

04:51.000 --> 04:53.280
should be forward.
You shall forget about life and death.

04:54.800 --> 04:57.840
You can't love one person or one object

04:57.920 --> 04:58.920
more than others in the world.

05:01.840 --> 05:03.200
That includes yourself.

05:03.280 --> 05:04.920
How come Xie Xuechen's Cage of Greed

05:05.000 --> 05:06.800
is different from others?

05:07.920 --> 05:09.720
Because he has no desire or greed.

05:10.840 --> 05:12.400
No desire or greed.

05:13.760 --> 05:15.480
How is that possible?

05:15.560 --> 05:16.760
His cultivation

05:16.840 --> 05:18.040
has reached the top.

05:18.920 --> 05:20.680
He sees fame as nothing but fog.

05:21.720 --> 05:23.040
Additionally, he has been forced to work

05:23.120 --> 05:24.320
on the way of detached.

05:25.480 --> 05:27.640
If he doesn't even care about his life,

05:29.240 --> 05:30.920
what desire could he possibly have?

05:35.280 --> 05:36.280
Desire Demon,

05:37.120 --> 05:38.560
can your Cage of Greed

05:39.160 --> 05:40.800
show more memories?

05:40.880 --> 05:42.680
Like his memories

05:43.360 --> 05:44.320
ten years ago?

05:47.400 --> 05:48.680
Saintess,

05:49.720 --> 05:51.280
this is the Cage of Greed.

05:52.320 --> 05:54.120
Things not related to greed…

05:59.640 --> 06:00.840
cannot be displayed.

06:06.640 --> 06:08.640
In that case,

06:10.360 --> 06:11.800
you are doing no good here.

06:16.560 --> 06:17.880
Saintess,

06:17.960 --> 06:18.840
what is this?

06:18.920 --> 06:20.960
Haven't I been

06:21.040 --> 06:22.000
obvious enough?

06:24.400 --> 06:25.400
You are going to kill me.

06:27.240 --> 06:28.520
We could just

06:28.600 --> 06:30.280
put on a show for Xie Xuechen.

06:30.360 --> 06:31.800
There's no need to kill me.

06:32.600 --> 06:33.600
If you kill me,

06:34.280 --> 06:35.680
my true form will know.

06:37.240 --> 06:38.960
Oh, you don't know.

06:39.040 --> 06:40.760
The Illusion Elixir has a defect.

06:40.840 --> 06:42.040
What is it?

06:42.120 --> 06:43.440
You'll see

06:43.520 --> 06:44.880
when you die.

06:45.560 --> 06:46.960
You have betrayed the Dark Abyss.

06:47.040 --> 06:47.960
Mu Xuanling, you…

07:02.920 --> 07:05.280
I can't believe that Mr. Xie,

07:05.880 --> 07:07.640
a master in the spiritual form level,

07:07.720 --> 07:10.320
would snatch the trophy of a lady.

07:10.960 --> 07:11.800
That's not right.

07:11.880 --> 07:13.120
A lady.

07:14.600 --> 07:15.880
Why didn't you think

07:16.920 --> 07:18.760
about right and wrong
when you were threatening me?

07:19.520 --> 07:20.480
Fine.

07:20.560 --> 07:21.760
You can have it.

07:21.840 --> 07:23.480
You can keep everything

07:24.080 --> 07:25.800
that I have.

07:40.000 --> 07:42.240
-You are dead.
-No, you are.

07:42.880 --> 07:44.720
-How did that happen?
-How could I know?

07:44.800 --> 07:46.240
You don't know?

07:46.320 --> 07:47.360
Why should she know?

07:48.320 --> 07:49.320
I mean,

07:49.400 --> 07:51.360
she was there when she died.
Shouldn't she know?

07:51.440 --> 07:52.280
Who would know? You?

07:54.560 --> 07:56.320
Clearly, something is wrong
with the Illusion Elixir.

07:57.360 --> 07:59.680
True forms only know
the projections are dead.

08:00.360 --> 08:02.160
We don't know what happened before that

08:03.080 --> 08:04.680
or who killed the projection.

08:08.000 --> 08:09.200
If I get the name

08:09.880 --> 08:11.920
of the cultivator who made the elixir,

08:12.600 --> 08:13.680
I will eat him alive!

08:13.760 --> 08:14.920
Stop it.

08:16.160 --> 08:18.440
Save your big words.

08:18.520 --> 08:22.000
You were so confident and tough

08:22.080 --> 08:23.320
before you went out.

08:23.400 --> 08:25.000
You said you would get Saintess

08:25.080 --> 08:26.240
and Xie Xuechen back.

08:28.360 --> 08:29.200
And how did that go?

08:30.440 --> 08:31.520
If you are so good,

08:32.520 --> 08:33.720
why don't you go?

08:36.520 --> 08:38.000
When I'm able to summon my projection,

08:38.080 --> 08:39.880
you don't need--

08:43.720 --> 08:45.200
We don't know

08:45.280 --> 08:47.520
whether Desire Demon
was killed by Xie Xuechen

08:48.120 --> 08:49.440
or Saintess,

08:50.440 --> 08:52.000
but we do know

08:52.080 --> 08:54.160
that one of them attacked for a kill.

08:57.160 --> 08:59.600
There's no need to hold back

08:59.680 --> 09:01.640
when we see them again.

09:10.960 --> 09:12.560
Aren't you worried that he might

09:12.640 --> 09:14.280
remember what happened when he wakes up?

09:15.280 --> 09:16.920
He's just an ordinary human.

09:17.000 --> 09:18.760
What if he's so scared
that he loses his mind?

09:18.840 --> 09:19.680
He won't.

09:19.760 --> 09:21.360
After being possessed
by a member of the Dark Clan,

09:22.760 --> 09:24.280
he won't know anything when he wakes up.

09:25.720 --> 09:27.040
Even if someone tells him

09:27.760 --> 09:29.360
or he tries countless times to recollect,

09:30.080 --> 09:30.920
he still won't remember.

09:32.040 --> 09:33.480
You know quite well about that.

09:34.280 --> 09:36.520
Have you been possessed
by a member of the Dark Clan before?

09:43.960 --> 09:45.320
Mr. Xie,

09:45.400 --> 09:47.240
I did take an arrow for you earlier.

09:47.840 --> 09:49.320
Though it happened in the illusion,

09:49.400 --> 09:50.640
it still hurts.

09:51.640 --> 09:53.520
You are not even asking about my injury.

09:54.360 --> 09:55.360
How about

09:55.440 --> 09:58.480
you let me consume
the demonic essence of Desire Demon?

09:58.560 --> 09:59.600
I can gain some power.

09:59.680 --> 10:01.480
What do I get

10:02.320 --> 10:03.560
from you gaining power?

10:08.640 --> 10:10.040
Is it possible
to talk some sense into you?

10:15.480 --> 10:16.680
Where are you going?

10:16.760 --> 10:18.360
Greenview Heights, right?

10:20.720 --> 10:23.240
There are only two major locations nearby.

10:23.320 --> 10:24.480
One is the Mirage Palace,

10:24.560 --> 10:26.200
and the other one
is the Greenview Heights.

10:27.040 --> 10:29.240
Mirage Palace is one of the five sects
of the Immortal Alliance,

10:30.040 --> 10:32.560
but you haven't identified
the traitor yet.

10:32.640 --> 10:33.920
You will not travel there
considering the situation.

10:34.640 --> 10:37.320
Though the Greenview Heights
is not a part of the Immortal Alliance,

10:37.960 --> 10:40.200
they are widely known
for their sophisticated arrays.

10:41.720 --> 10:43.440
I even heard that the owner
of the Greenview Heights

10:43.520 --> 10:44.880
invented a teleporting array

10:45.640 --> 10:48.440
that could send someone
to thousands of miles away in an instant.

10:48.520 --> 10:51.160
You want to use the teleporting array
to get back to the Snow City quickly,

10:51.760 --> 10:52.600
right?

10:56.560 --> 10:57.400
Miss Mu,

10:58.880 --> 11:00.720
I, Xie Xuechen, am not an ungrateful man.

11:00.800 --> 11:02.400
You saved me.

11:02.480 --> 11:03.480
For that, I should thank you.

11:04.880 --> 11:06.280
But we are not the same kind of people.

11:07.560 --> 11:08.760
If you keep following me,

11:08.840 --> 11:10.320
there will be a fight between us

11:11.040 --> 11:12.520
when I get my spiritual power back.

11:13.360 --> 11:16.480
It's better for us
to separate our ways here.

11:16.560 --> 11:18.760
You should know that there's a saying

11:18.840 --> 11:20.240
that all roads lead
to the same destination.

11:21.400 --> 11:24.360
If a road becomes my obstacle,
I'll wipe the road

11:24.440 --> 11:25.320
off the map.

11:25.400 --> 11:26.960
Why do you have to haunt me like this?

11:28.120 --> 11:29.360
What do you want?

11:33.840 --> 11:34.960
What if I tell you

11:36.320 --> 11:37.960
that I want to start a new life
and follow your lead?

11:50.040 --> 11:52.480
Do you think
it's a happy life working for Sang Qi?

11:52.560 --> 11:54.160
Members of the Spirit Clan are mostly

11:54.240 --> 11:55.680
driven off or enslaved by humans.

11:55.760 --> 11:57.680
I had to obey him.

11:58.480 --> 12:00.720
I have been wanting to leave
that place for a long time now.

12:02.040 --> 12:03.280
Things are interesting

12:03.360 --> 12:04.600
when I'm with you.

12:04.680 --> 12:06.520
Being a common person is actually nice.

12:09.120 --> 12:11.760
You could just get rid of your demonic
power and be a common person.

12:17.080 --> 12:18.320
My spiritual apertures are damaged.

12:19.200 --> 12:20.240
I can't gain spiritual power.

12:21.240 --> 12:24.760
The demonic power
is the only thing I can rely on.

12:25.320 --> 12:26.360
However,

12:27.040 --> 12:28.360
if I would get rid

12:29.000 --> 12:31.640
of my demonic power for you
and become a common person,

12:34.120 --> 12:35.400
will you protect me?

12:45.480 --> 12:47.120
Do you think I would buy it?

12:53.480 --> 12:54.600
Either way,

12:55.120 --> 12:57.120
you don't have the power
to fight me right now.

12:58.080 --> 12:59.920
I'm also looking for an answer.

13:00.520 --> 13:01.880
Before that,

13:02.680 --> 13:04.240
you have to stay by my side.

13:05.400 --> 13:06.520
Mr. Xie.

13:10.680 --> 13:12.480
They may have the Illusion Elixir,

13:12.560 --> 13:14.120
but we have the Anti-illusion Hairpin.

13:14.800 --> 13:17.040
The Desire Demon
can summon projections now.

13:17.120 --> 13:18.960
Ignorance Demon and Anger Demon
can't be too far behind.

13:19.040 --> 13:20.960
Our journey ahead is not optimistic.

13:21.640 --> 13:23.800
To avoid being detected
by the Demon Array,

13:23.880 --> 13:25.560
we need more than hiding our energy.

13:25.640 --> 13:28.200
The Anti-illusion Hairpin
masks one's face.

13:29.480 --> 13:30.320
When others see you,

13:31.320 --> 13:33.560
you'd look so ordinary

13:33.640 --> 13:34.640
that they will forget you in an instant.

13:37.800 --> 13:39.920
I have one as well. They are a pair.

13:40.440 --> 13:41.560
Put it on for me.

14:03.840 --> 14:05.360
Such a difficult man.

14:06.680 --> 14:08.240
HE'D STEAL THE HORSE AND LEAVE ME BEHIND

14:08.320 --> 14:10.200
WHEN I'M BEING SO GENTLE. DIFFICULT

14:26.640 --> 14:27.800
How many members
of the Dark Clan have you killed?

14:28.480 --> 14:29.600
Quite a lot.

14:29.680 --> 14:31.360
That's less than my kills.

14:37.560 --> 14:38.600
What are you writing?

14:39.360 --> 14:41.320
Your habits and preferences.

14:41.400 --> 14:43.920
I heard that two have to be intimate

14:44.000 --> 14:45.520
to spend their lives together.

14:56.400 --> 14:58.080
Why are you always so defensive?

14:58.160 --> 15:00.040
Since we met,

15:00.120 --> 15:01.680
all I've been doing is helping you.

15:04.840 --> 15:06.480
To be intimate. Then what?

15:09.360 --> 15:10.400
Take a walk!

15:20.800 --> 15:22.240
The minds of cultivators

15:22.320 --> 15:24.120
are crystal clear and indestructible.

15:24.200 --> 15:26.000
Once their inner demons are triggered,

15:26.600 --> 15:27.960
they'll become mortals.

15:29.840 --> 15:30.920
Even with sufficient spiritual power,

15:31.000 --> 15:33.440
they'd be powerless when facing

15:33.520 --> 15:34.680
members of the Dark Clan.

15:36.200 --> 15:37.200
Maybe

15:38.560 --> 15:40.120
that's what you want.

15:53.080 --> 15:54.400
Do you really not know

15:55.520 --> 15:56.880
what I want?

16:05.920 --> 16:07.360
We've been staying together
for a while now.

16:08.000 --> 16:09.440
You have never asked

16:09.520 --> 16:10.560
which spirit clan I belong to.

16:11.440 --> 16:13.000
Don't you want

16:13.080 --> 16:14.440
to know me better?

16:14.960 --> 16:15.960
I'm not asking.

16:16.840 --> 16:17.720
You are going to tell me anyway.

16:22.000 --> 16:23.200
I'm a Viny Spirit.

16:24.000 --> 16:26.200
As a child, half of my face

16:26.280 --> 16:27.840
was covered in vine-like demon patterns.

16:39.120 --> 16:40.120
This half.

16:40.200 --> 16:42.160
A prominently large area.

16:42.240 --> 16:43.800
People usually don't forget

16:43.880 --> 16:45.040
something like that.

17:00.720 --> 17:03.440
-You don't remember it even one bit.
-What did you say?

17:06.200 --> 17:07.400
Nothing.

17:07.480 --> 17:08.760
Bad memory.

17:08.839 --> 17:10.000
BRAG ABOUT BEING GENEROUS
A BIT EXAGGERTATED

17:13.800 --> 17:15.200
It's getting late.

17:15.280 --> 17:16.920
We should find a staging post.

17:17.880 --> 17:19.760
Even if you don't need rest,
think about the horse.

17:20.560 --> 17:21.920
Think for all lives in the world.

17:22.000 --> 17:23.319
That horse is one of them.

17:27.599 --> 17:28.600
Xie Xuechen.

17:29.440 --> 17:30.600
I'm also one of them.

17:35.120 --> 17:37.360
RELAXATION INN

17:40.800 --> 17:42.480
Make yourselves at home.

17:42.560 --> 17:43.440
Coming!

17:43.520 --> 17:45.600
GUESTS FROM ALL OVER THE WORLD
DELICACIES FROM LAND AND SEA

17:46.320 --> 17:47.840
Waiter, two more pots of liquor here.

17:47.920 --> 17:48.920
Yes.

17:50.400 --> 17:51.400
Sir, here's your liquor.

17:56.400 --> 17:58.000
Owner, two rooms, please.

18:00.000 --> 18:01.920
Madam, I'm so sorry.

18:02.000 --> 18:04.040
We are nearly fully booked today.

18:04.120 --> 18:06.280
There's only one room left.

18:06.880 --> 18:08.880
Could you share a room

18:08.960 --> 18:09.800
with your servant?

18:09.880 --> 18:10.920
No.

18:14.200 --> 18:15.240
Do come back!

18:16.120 --> 18:18.040
How about you stay with my staff?

18:18.960 --> 18:20.600
-Great.
-What's great about that?

18:21.520 --> 18:22.920
How bad is your eyesight?

18:23.000 --> 18:24.400
He's my husband.

18:33.480 --> 18:35.640
I'm sorry for the abruptness.
Please accept my apology.

18:36.920 --> 18:38.400
Waiter.

18:38.480 --> 18:40.200
Take our guests to the Premium Room One.

18:40.280 --> 18:41.400
Yes.

18:41.480 --> 18:42.960
-Madam and sir, this way, please.
-Please.

18:51.360 --> 18:53.640
They are a strange couple.

18:53.720 --> 18:55.360
The guy seems to be forced.

18:55.440 --> 18:56.640
Is he held hostage?

18:57.480 --> 18:58.800
That guy may seem weak,

18:58.880 --> 18:59.880
but he looks spirited.

18:59.960 --> 19:01.360
Though I can't feel his spiritual energy,

19:01.440 --> 19:02.800
he should be a good fighter
among the common people.

19:03.400 --> 19:05.600
That woman looks ordinary.

19:05.680 --> 19:06.880
She can't hold him hostage.

19:07.600 --> 19:08.840
I heard that there are
a lot of demons nearby.

19:09.520 --> 19:11.160
-Maybe…
-Brother,

19:11.240 --> 19:13.960
you are worrying too much.
They are just two common people.

19:14.040 --> 19:15.240
They don't have the demonic energy.

19:16.120 --> 19:18.080
I heard that this place
has a rough custom.

19:18.680 --> 19:21.880
Women would force guys
to be their husbands.

19:22.400 --> 19:23.840
That woman is clearly

19:23.920 --> 19:25.240
from a well-off family.

19:25.320 --> 19:26.960
That man may look ordinary,

19:27.040 --> 19:28.040
but he has a great figure,

19:28.120 --> 19:29.480
and he looks spirited.

19:29.560 --> 19:31.560
There must be something special about him.

19:31.640 --> 19:32.960
That's why you are the sophisticated one.

19:33.760 --> 19:35.360
Mr. Xie,

19:35.440 --> 19:37.320
there is something special about you.

19:38.840 --> 19:39.680
Take care, sir.

19:41.040 --> 19:42.280
Madam. Sir. This is your room.

19:42.360 --> 19:43.360
The Premium Room One.

19:43.960 --> 19:44.920
PREMIUM ROOM ONE

19:45.000 --> 19:46.000
This way.

19:55.480 --> 19:56.920
Judging from the patterns

19:57.000 --> 19:58.520
on the cultivators' clothes,

19:58.600 --> 20:00.120
they must be from the Mirage Palace.

20:00.200 --> 20:01.880
What are they doing here?

20:03.600 --> 20:05.000
Is there

20:05.080 --> 20:07.920
a high-ranking cultivator
of the Mirage Palace here?

20:12.240 --> 20:13.520
Mr. Xie,

20:13.600 --> 20:16.040
are you thinking about
sending them a message?

20:18.200 --> 20:19.560
What do you want?

20:20.600 --> 20:23.080
Are you worried that I may
silence you once and for all?

20:24.200 --> 20:25.280
Isn't that your intention?

20:27.080 --> 20:28.800
Maybe.

20:28.880 --> 20:30.200
Maybe not.

20:32.120 --> 20:34.920
Your worrying is not baseless.

20:36.080 --> 20:38.200
I'm not a good person.

20:42.560 --> 20:43.920
You are not a person.

20:48.360 --> 20:49.400
There's demonic energy.

20:51.240 --> 20:52.840
I've hidden mine well.

20:54.440 --> 20:55.720
Take care of our guests!

20:55.800 --> 20:56.800
Take care, sir.

20:59.760 --> 21:00.760
Ladies, welcome.

21:04.000 --> 21:08.520
GAO QIUMIN
YOUNG LORD OF THE MIRAGE PALACE

21:12.440 --> 21:13.800
-Miss Gao!
-Miss Gao.

21:15.000 --> 21:15.920
It's been a while.

21:16.000 --> 21:17.880
-Please sit down.
-It's her.

21:17.960 --> 21:19.360
This humble dish is on the house.

21:20.120 --> 21:21.440
Enjoy.

21:23.120 --> 21:24.720
-Thank you.
-Miss Gao,

21:24.800 --> 21:25.640
we've been waiting for you to come back.

21:26.320 --> 21:29.000
Lu and I have checked the east side.
We didn't find anything.

21:29.080 --> 21:31.200
Have you spotted any abnormality?

21:31.280 --> 21:32.560
Mr. Song.

21:32.640 --> 21:34.040
You have no idea.

21:34.120 --> 21:36.000
A member of the Spirit Clan sneaked up
on Miss Gao and me.

21:36.880 --> 21:38.240
Which Spirit Clan? Are you hurt?

21:38.320 --> 21:40.960
Miss Gao is talented and skillful.

21:41.040 --> 21:43.280
Who would be able to hurt me
with her there?

21:43.360 --> 21:44.560
Oh, right!

21:44.640 --> 21:46.200
This is the one.

21:46.280 --> 21:48.720
This little bold demonic animal.

21:48.800 --> 21:49.800
Miss Gao said

21:49.880 --> 21:52.120
that this is a Treasure Sniffer,
one of the ten rare animals.

21:52.200 --> 21:55.360
It has the best hearing and nose.

21:55.440 --> 21:57.800
They can find any treasure.

21:58.560 --> 21:59.920
Give it to me. Here.

22:01.040 --> 22:03.360
Miss Gao and I ran into it.

22:03.440 --> 22:04.360
There's no way to tell
where this little guy

22:04.440 --> 22:05.880
got so many treasures.

22:08.080 --> 22:10.320
-Those are all rare sacred relics.
-Tell me about it.

22:10.400 --> 22:12.600
Little mouse,
you've stolen so many valuables.

22:12.680 --> 22:14.520
The Spirit Management Bureau
will not let you off

22:14.600 --> 22:15.640
if they catch you.

22:16.320 --> 22:17.360
Miss Gao,

22:17.440 --> 22:20.040
you seem to adore
the Treasure Sniffer a lot.

22:20.720 --> 22:22.560
Are you going to make it
a spiritual animal?

22:22.640 --> 22:25.160
The Treasure Sniffer is a rare animal,

22:25.240 --> 22:28.000
but it seems quite weak.

22:28.080 --> 22:29.480
It can't help you in combat.

22:29.560 --> 22:31.000
I don't think it can make
a good spiritual animal.

22:31.080 --> 22:33.160
I, alone, am enough to face enemies.

22:33.240 --> 22:34.440
What do I need a spiritual animal for?

22:34.520 --> 22:36.280
Miss Gao is right on point.

22:36.360 --> 22:39.040
I heard that Mr. Xie of the Snow City

22:39.120 --> 22:40.880
roam the world with just his sword.

22:40.960 --> 22:42.720
He never needed the help
of a spiritual animal.

22:42.800 --> 22:44.400
Miss Gao and Mr. Xie

22:44.480 --> 22:46.000
are both talented cultivators.

22:46.080 --> 22:48.400
-We cannot hope to compare with you.
-Agreed.

22:48.480 --> 22:51.000
All right. We have business here.

22:51.080 --> 22:52.560
Let's take a rest
and get back to searching.

22:52.640 --> 22:54.080
-Yes.
-Yes.

22:57.920 --> 23:00.280
Little mouse, look at your golden ears.

23:00.360 --> 23:01.440
You are so cute.

23:04.240 --> 23:05.160
Treasure Sniffers are timid.

23:06.040 --> 23:07.800
Their gallbladders may break
if scared and causing death.

23:08.760 --> 23:09.760
Look at its ears.

23:10.360 --> 23:11.560
The more they shake,
the brighter they are.

23:11.640 --> 23:12.720
That may seem beautiful,

23:12.800 --> 23:14.040
but it is the sign
of gallbladder breaking.

23:21.360 --> 23:22.200
Who's there?

23:22.280 --> 23:23.280
Who is it?

23:25.600 --> 23:26.640
Over there!

23:29.040 --> 23:31.360
-What is this?
-They are coming up to deal with us.

23:31.440 --> 23:32.640
That's your problem.

23:34.480 --> 23:35.920
We are in no condition to draw boundaries.

23:37.240 --> 23:39.160
-What are you doing?
-Work with me!

23:45.120 --> 23:46.400
Who are you?

23:46.480 --> 23:47.880
Why did you barge into my room?

23:49.600 --> 23:50.960
I'm sorry. Sorry.

23:51.680 --> 23:52.960
Leave!

23:53.480 --> 23:55.200
Let's go. Come on.

23:55.280 --> 23:56.880
Close the door!

24:00.760 --> 24:02.920
They don't have the energy
of the Spirit Clan.

24:06.800 --> 24:07.800
Get up!

24:09.560 --> 24:10.560
No.

24:17.800 --> 24:19.120
What if

24:19.200 --> 24:21.840
they are still listening outside?

24:21.920 --> 24:24.040
We are already in this situation.

24:24.120 --> 24:27.160
How about we go along with it?

24:27.240 --> 24:28.240
Let me go!

24:31.480 --> 24:32.520
Haven't you had enough fun?

24:34.000 --> 24:35.000
No.

24:38.120 --> 24:40.320
The three of you search the perimeter.

24:40.400 --> 24:41.760
We might get struck
by the Spirit Clan tonight.

24:42.360 --> 24:43.480
We will keep looking

24:43.560 --> 24:45.000
for Xie Xuechen first thing
tomorrow morning.

24:45.640 --> 24:47.120
-Yes, Miss Gao.
-Let's go.

24:49.840 --> 24:51.560
So, you are the one they are looking for.

24:52.600 --> 24:56.640
In the Mirage Palace,
there's only one woman with high status

24:56.720 --> 24:57.840
named Gao.

24:58.880 --> 25:01.680
The once Young Lady
of the Moonlight Heights

25:01.760 --> 25:04.960
and the current direct disciple
of the Mirage Palace,

25:05.040 --> 25:05.880
Gao Qiumin.

25:05.960 --> 25:07.080
So what?

25:08.960 --> 25:10.040
I heard that

25:11.280 --> 25:12.480
she has a marriage arrangement with you.

25:18.040 --> 25:20.720
Lying in bed with me
under your fiance's nose.

25:21.680 --> 25:22.920
Isn't that exciting?

25:23.000 --> 25:24.480
She's not my fiance.

25:26.480 --> 25:27.920
Are you explaining to me

25:28.000 --> 25:29.120
so that I won't be annoyed?

25:32.200 --> 25:33.200
Xie Xuechen.

25:34.000 --> 25:36.040
We should be a couple.

25:36.120 --> 25:37.480
I will treat you better than her.

25:47.240 --> 25:48.800
I've never seen a person

25:49.600 --> 25:52.200
as shameless as you are.

25:54.600 --> 25:57.360
You've got half of it.

25:58.320 --> 25:59.680
I'm not a person,

25:59.760 --> 26:01.720
but I am a little shameless.

26:01.800 --> 26:02.880
A little?

26:09.160 --> 26:11.400
Mr. Xie, your heart
is beating really fast.

26:12.840 --> 26:14.200
Is that because of me?

26:15.240 --> 26:17.480
Do you have feelings for me now?

26:18.760 --> 26:19.760
Yes.

26:23.560 --> 26:24.520
The feeling of killing you.

26:25.240 --> 26:27.840
All right. That's still a kind of feeling.

26:27.920 --> 26:30.640
You will remember me, at least.

26:32.120 --> 26:33.440
What I fear

26:34.120 --> 26:35.440
is that you won't remember me.

26:42.680 --> 26:47.320
RELAXATION INN

27:14.640 --> 27:15.480
Treasure Sniffer.

27:16.800 --> 27:18.120
Didn't you run off?

27:18.200 --> 27:19.760
What are you doing back here?

27:20.520 --> 27:22.800
Do you smell treasure on me?

27:22.880 --> 27:24.240
Miss!

27:24.320 --> 27:25.520
You can talk!

27:27.520 --> 27:28.800
Can you transform into a human form?

27:28.880 --> 27:31.560
I… I just learned how to do it.

27:39.520 --> 27:43.720
BAO

27:43.800 --> 27:46.080
You are a cute young girl.

27:46.760 --> 27:47.600
Come.

27:48.160 --> 27:49.280
Get up.

27:49.360 --> 27:50.360
Sit.

27:53.440 --> 27:54.280
Where are your parents?

27:56.360 --> 27:57.720
My father has left

27:57.800 --> 27:59.000
and my mother is at home.

28:00.040 --> 28:01.440
Did you sneak out?

28:04.360 --> 28:06.160
Don't be afraid. He won't hurt you.

28:07.440 --> 28:09.560
I just want to find Father.

28:09.640 --> 28:10.840
I didn't do anything bad.

28:10.920 --> 28:13.000
Don't take me
to the Spirit Management Bureau.

28:13.880 --> 28:15.680
Mother said that Father

28:15.760 --> 28:17.680
was the richest cultivator in the world.

28:17.760 --> 28:19.840
He left all those valuables to me.

28:19.920 --> 28:22.200
I didn't steal anything. I swear.

28:22.280 --> 28:25.880
The richest sect would be
the Jade Sky Palace.

28:25.960 --> 28:26.960
Is your father

28:27.040 --> 28:29.600
-the lord of the Jade Sky Palace?
-Don't knock it.

28:37.720 --> 28:38.920
What's your father's name?

28:39.520 --> 28:41.400
Fu… Fu Cangli.

28:41.480 --> 28:42.800
Mister, do you know my father?

28:42.880 --> 28:44.960
The family name of the lord
of the Jade Sky Palace is Fu.

28:45.960 --> 28:47.040
But I've never heard

28:47.120 --> 28:49.280
of someone named Fu Cangli
from the Jade Sky Palace.

28:49.880 --> 28:50.840
What's your name?

28:51.560 --> 28:52.760
Bao.

28:53.360 --> 28:54.240
Have you never registered
at the Spirit Management Bureau?

28:55.520 --> 28:57.760
Mother said that they would

28:57.840 --> 29:00.600
put a spirit lock on me,

29:00.680 --> 29:02.440
and I would be controlled by humans.

29:02.520 --> 29:04.680
I will be a slave for my whole life.

29:05.880 --> 29:08.880
Mother said that it's not right.

29:09.560 --> 29:12.120
I heard that
you've been in seclusion for years,

29:12.200 --> 29:13.320
and you seldom left Snow City.

29:14.000 --> 29:15.960
It seems that you don't know the situation

29:16.040 --> 29:17.200
of the Spirit Clan very well.

29:18.120 --> 29:20.200
The oppression humans
put on the Spirit Clan

29:20.280 --> 29:21.880
is worse than ever.

29:23.640 --> 29:25.800
Members of Spirit Clan who are registered
at the Spirit Management Bureau

29:25.880 --> 29:28.320
will become slaves for humans.

29:28.400 --> 29:30.240
They will be beaten, scolded, killed,

29:30.760 --> 29:32.280
and be sold as the owners want.

29:33.200 --> 29:34.640
They will never have freedom.

29:35.280 --> 29:37.560
Those who are not registered

29:37.640 --> 29:39.240
are not deemed as good demons.

29:40.080 --> 29:41.720
They are killable,

29:41.800 --> 29:42.880
regardless of their behaviors.

29:43.560 --> 29:44.920
That's the rules

29:45.000 --> 29:47.080
that humans set on their own.

29:48.040 --> 29:50.320
How unreasonable? How shameless?

29:52.640 --> 29:53.760
Shall I take you home?

29:54.400 --> 29:56.640
I've lost all my valuables.

29:56.720 --> 29:58.960
I've lost all the valuables
my father left.

29:59.040 --> 30:01.840
I can't go home like this.

30:02.480 --> 30:03.480
There, there.

30:04.240 --> 30:05.120
Don't cry.

30:05.200 --> 30:06.880
I'll get them back for you. All right?

30:06.960 --> 30:08.880
Gao Qiumin is quite powerful.

30:08.960 --> 30:09.800
Don't look for trouble.

30:12.360 --> 30:15.080
Gao Qiumin robbed Bao.

30:15.160 --> 30:17.320
I'm just helping her to get
her things back. It's how it should be.

30:19.480 --> 30:20.440
Since this is a misunderstanding,

30:21.200 --> 30:22.160
just explain to them.

30:25.000 --> 30:26.400
Do you think they would believe us?

30:27.560 --> 30:28.760
Do you think they won't turn Bao

30:29.560 --> 30:30.760
to the Spirit Management Bureau?

30:33.400 --> 30:35.560
Mr. Xie, you are a human.

30:35.640 --> 30:37.080
I understand that you'd speak for humans.

30:38.160 --> 30:39.400
But I am from the Spirit Clan.

30:40.000 --> 30:41.480
I will fight for justice for my kind.

30:42.640 --> 30:44.080
You have your own ideas
of right and wrong.

30:44.160 --> 30:45.520
I'm not trying to persuade you.

30:46.200 --> 30:47.360
Just stay out of my way.

30:59.920 --> 31:00.920
Where are they?

31:03.880 --> 31:05.400
Miss Gao, what…

31:23.520 --> 31:24.880
I sensed that something was not right.

31:25.800 --> 31:26.880
Why would a couple

31:27.480 --> 31:28.560
wear shoes when they are in bed?

31:30.320 --> 31:31.880
It was clearly a cover-up.

31:33.240 --> 31:34.760
Thanks to the intelligence of Miss Gao,

31:34.840 --> 31:36.240
your cover was blown.

31:36.840 --> 31:38.160
Miss Gao, you are incredible.

31:39.440 --> 31:41.840
I told you to be patient.

31:41.920 --> 31:43.720
You should have taken off my shoes

31:43.800 --> 31:44.880
before taking off my clothes.

31:44.960 --> 31:47.640
You see? That has caused misunderstanding.

31:48.800 --> 31:50.240
Remember it next time.

31:51.960 --> 31:53.880
Things like that

31:53.960 --> 31:55.520
require patience.

31:56.280 --> 31:57.480
But…

31:59.120 --> 32:00.000
I do like your way.

32:04.560 --> 32:06.400
Stop with the disgusting talk.

32:06.480 --> 32:08.440
Do not try to fool me with your words.

32:08.520 --> 32:11.000
This is the day that you will be captured

32:11.080 --> 32:12.800
with the Treasure Sniffer. Get them!

32:25.400 --> 32:26.760
You…

32:27.360 --> 32:29.400
Who is it? It's so late.
People need to sleep!

32:32.960 --> 32:34.600
I'm sorry.

32:37.960 --> 32:39.280
Demonic cultivator!

32:50.120 --> 32:51.160
Get them!

33:02.400 --> 33:04.400
A human and a demonic cultivator

33:04.480 --> 33:06.600
colluding together
can never be a good thing.

33:07.200 --> 33:09.160
I'm going to take your heads today.

33:09.840 --> 33:10.760
Miss,

33:11.560 --> 33:13.560
-we have no evil intentions.
-Save your words.

33:54.840 --> 33:55.760
I've long heard

33:55.840 --> 33:57.520
the Array of Flowery Edges
of the Mirage Palace.

33:58.360 --> 33:59.520
If it is

33:59.600 --> 34:01.880
your lord, Su Ningzhen, who's here,

34:01.960 --> 34:05.120
I might be intimidated a little.
As for you…

34:14.440 --> 34:16.239
Miss Gao! Miss Gao!

34:20.360 --> 34:21.760
This demonic cultivator is very powerful.

34:21.840 --> 34:22.880
Let's go!

34:22.960 --> 34:24.239
Trying to leave?

34:49.679 --> 34:52.560
A spirit slave with a face
full of disgusting demon patterns.

34:52.639 --> 34:54.000
How dare you come out
and scare people with that?

34:57.080 --> 34:58.240
Steward!

34:58.320 --> 34:59.160
Go.

34:59.240 --> 35:00.280
Get her an iron mask.

35:01.160 --> 35:02.560
She will not scare anyone again.

35:03.280 --> 35:04.280
Yes.

35:16.560 --> 35:17.560
Hurry up. Give her

35:17.640 --> 35:19.560
-Her Ladyship's clothes.
-Give it back!

35:19.640 --> 35:21.600
Her Ladyship is of high status.

35:21.680 --> 35:23.880
To die in her place is the biggest glory

35:23.960 --> 35:25.600
for a slave like you.

35:28.520 --> 35:30.120
Big Brother!

35:53.800 --> 35:55.040
You are stopping me.

35:55.120 --> 35:56.480
You've won.

35:57.080 --> 35:58.120
Let them go.

35:59.320 --> 36:00.400
And if I don't?

36:01.440 --> 36:02.960
I won't let you kill anyone.

36:10.200 --> 36:11.160
Go!

36:16.800 --> 36:17.840
They were trying to kill you,

36:18.560 --> 36:19.920
and I protected you.

36:20.000 --> 36:21.800
They can't fight back now.

36:22.360 --> 36:23.560
You don't have to kill her.

36:24.160 --> 36:25.040
Why do you insist?

36:25.120 --> 36:26.720
Because this is who I am.

36:27.400 --> 36:29.000
How come she could try to kill me,

36:29.960 --> 36:31.200
and I can't kill her?

36:32.320 --> 36:33.360
Is someone only worthy

36:33.440 --> 36:35.040
of protection when you want to offer it?

36:35.120 --> 36:37.560
Are all the decisions only right
when you approve of them?

36:45.080 --> 36:46.360
Miss Gao, this is our chance.

36:47.520 --> 36:49.240
I don't feel right
about leaving someone to die.

36:49.840 --> 36:51.160
We can't save him anyway.

36:51.760 --> 36:53.280
Since he dared to strike
the demonic cultivator,

36:53.360 --> 36:54.880
he must know what he was doing.

36:54.960 --> 36:56.520
Let's go back to the sect and report this.

36:56.600 --> 36:57.640
Come on.

37:17.120 --> 37:18.720
You are using your blood as a sword.

37:20.240 --> 37:21.840
Do you want to protect her so much?

37:21.920 --> 37:23.200
I've said it.

37:24.000 --> 37:25.520
I won't let you kill anyone.

37:26.160 --> 37:27.480
You have no spiritual power right now.

37:28.520 --> 37:29.720
Even if you summoned the blood sword,

37:30.280 --> 37:32.080
I can still defeat you easily

37:32.160 --> 37:33.640
in countless ways.

39:17.480 --> 39:18.640
The blood sword was a distraction.

39:19.920 --> 39:21.200
This trap is your true intention.

39:21.800 --> 39:23.360
You pretended to fight with me

39:24.360 --> 39:25.960
and used your blood

39:26.040 --> 39:27.240
to set up this trap.

39:28.760 --> 39:29.920
The blood of a spiritual form cultivator

39:30.640 --> 39:32.160
is the purest spiritual material.

39:33.400 --> 39:35.600
You must have spilt your blood secretly

39:36.320 --> 39:37.920
when you were fighting with me

39:39.280 --> 39:41.280
and created this trap step by step.

39:41.360 --> 39:43.200
Have you been showing your weakness

39:44.040 --> 39:45.320
and tolerated me all this time

39:46.240 --> 39:47.560
for this moment?

39:48.480 --> 39:50.560
You could have set up a killing array.

39:50.640 --> 39:52.320
Why make it merely a trap?

39:53.360 --> 39:54.360
You saved me.

39:55.000 --> 39:57.320
I'm paying you back by not killing you.

39:58.240 --> 40:00.720
Should I thank you
for your virtue of being grateful?

40:02.320 --> 40:04.440
Why didn't you use your demonic power?

40:04.520 --> 40:05.520
If you did…

40:05.600 --> 40:06.800
You'd be dead already.

40:07.880 --> 40:09.040
You are severely injured

40:09.640 --> 40:11.000
and without
the protection of spiritual power.

40:11.600 --> 40:12.760
You are no match for my demonic power.

40:18.640 --> 40:19.640
You hurt people with demonic power

40:20.680 --> 40:22.000
while I save people
with my array of blood.

40:22.800 --> 40:23.800
We are destined to be different.

40:24.400 --> 40:25.400
Let's put an end

40:26.320 --> 40:27.480
to this charade.

40:29.760 --> 40:31.480
I kill people with demonic power

40:32.240 --> 40:34.360
while you kill people with your sword.

40:34.440 --> 40:36.160
What's the difference between these two?

40:36.840 --> 40:38.520
If I do want to kill you,

40:38.600 --> 40:40.040
you'd already been dead.

40:43.480 --> 40:45.240
You are using my kindness.

40:49.040 --> 40:50.200
Xie Xuechen.

40:51.880 --> 40:52.800
You really left.

40:53.480 --> 40:54.480
Xie Xuechen!

40:55.720 --> 40:56.560
I…

40:56.640 --> 40:58.920
I have something important to tell you.

40:59.520 --> 41:00.400
Come back.

41:05.000 --> 41:07.800
-Miss Mu!
-Bao!

41:07.880 --> 41:10.280
I… I will get you out right away!

41:11.480 --> 41:12.320
Bao!

41:12.400 --> 41:13.680
Don't touch that.

41:14.560 --> 41:15.800
It won't work.

41:15.880 --> 41:17.120
Miss Mu,

41:17.200 --> 41:19.600
you can break

41:19.680 --> 41:22.080
that Array of Flowery something,

41:22.160 --> 41:24.080
but not this one?

41:25.960 --> 41:28.080
An array can consist of four elements,

41:29.120 --> 41:30.640
which are guarding,

41:30.720 --> 41:34.160
trapping, killing, and uniqueness.

41:34.680 --> 41:36.280
The more elements

41:36.360 --> 41:37.720
an array contains,

41:38.320 --> 41:39.720
the less power each element gets.

41:40.480 --> 41:42.920
The Array of Flowery Edges
has all four elements,

41:43.000 --> 41:44.640
making it easy to break.

41:45.160 --> 41:46.400
But this Shackle of Delicacy

41:46.960 --> 41:48.800
is the best trapping array in the world.

41:49.400 --> 41:50.520
It focuses only on trapping,

41:51.440 --> 41:53.160
making it hard to break.

41:53.240 --> 41:56.440
What if
the Spirit Management Bureau is here?

41:56.520 --> 41:57.760
You…

41:57.840 --> 42:01.000
I… I will get help now!

42:01.920 --> 42:03.120
I've checked this array.

42:03.920 --> 42:04.920
The Shackle of Delicacy

42:05.560 --> 42:07.320
is designed based on Hetu and Luoshu.

42:07.880 --> 42:09.000
It's unpredictable.

42:10.240 --> 42:11.560
It won't be broken easily.

42:17.240 --> 42:19.320
Bao! Bao?

42:23.520 --> 42:24.920
Did she really go to get help?

42:34.360 --> 42:35.480
Xie Xuechen.

42:37.000 --> 42:38.280
The only reason
you went to lengths to protect her

42:39.520 --> 42:41.040
was that she's a human.

42:52.800 --> 42:54.200
Did I choose

42:56.320 --> 42:57.760
my clan?

43:08.360 --> 43:09.560
A pair?

43:09.640 --> 43:10.840
What good does that do?

43:33.240 --> 43:36.320
FENG YAO

43:44.160 --> 43:45.640
Sir, we are here.

43:47.480 --> 43:49.560
What are we doing here?

43:51.280 --> 43:52.720
An old divination result

43:52.800 --> 43:54.160
pointed out that I would meet

43:54.240 --> 43:55.760
an old friend here today.

43:55.840 --> 43:58.200
I'm just not sure
if she still remembers me.
